      "writtenOn": "2021-09-23T02:16:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not sufficient. Someone could put a fake FMAP at a large alignment in the RW section and you would never reach the real FMAP. It needs to call the whole validation process from within this loop, and return to keep seeking from where it left off if there was any error along the verification process.",
